# --- STM32CubeIDE build output ---
# Build configuration folders: objects, deps, .elf/.map/.list, generated makefiles
Debug/
Release/

# Per-file analysis output (in case a build lands outside Debug/Release)
*.o
*.d
*.su
*.cyclo

# --- Eclipse / CubeIDE workspace & indexer state ---
.metadata/
RemoteSystemsTempFiles/
# Regenerated by the indexer with machine-specific compiler paths
**/.settings/language.settings.xml

# --- Editor / OS clutter ---
*.bak
*~
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
